12
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:27,390
Hey, good for you!

13
00:00:27,390 --> 00:00:29,060
Yeah, I just want
to put it out there

14
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:30,130
(Howard:)in case I inadvertently

15
00:00:30,130 --> 00:00:32,890
