in your direction.

16
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:34,830
(Howard:)Happy?

17
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,470
So, Priya, what are your
plans while you're here?

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:41,470
(Priya:)I don't know. I just
have the one day.

19
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:44,670
(Sheldon:)Do you like trains?

20
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:46,140
(Priya:)Not particularly.

21
00:00:49,110 --> 00:00:53,300
(Sheldon:)You might as well just wait
at the airport for your flight.

22
00:00:54,470 --> 00:00:56,500
"You are in a forest.

23
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:58,170
"There is quicksand to the west,

24
